{{#> layout title=(concat "Welcome to " appName) preheader="Your account is ready. Your files, in one place, shared with the people you choose." reason=(concat "because a " appName " account was made with this address")}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Your account is ready. Three things to start with:</p>
{{#> details}}{{> step number="1" title="Add your files" text="Drop files or whole folders in, or make a document right there."}}{{> step number="2" title="Share them" text="Give a person or a group access to a file or a folder."}}{{> step number="3" title="Write together" text="Open a shared document and edit it with others at the same time."}}{{/details}}
{{> button url=loginUrl label=(concat "Open " appName)}}
<p class="muted" style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:22px; color:{{look.muted}};">The same sign-in works in Mollama, where you can attach these files to a chat.</p>
{{/layout}}
